+// google/filament v1.75.0, tag commit 0e58877c09afb1aacd09ff640f74d2adcd2a7e80,
+// Apache-2.0, `filament/src/Froxelizer.{h,cpp}` + `filament/src/
+// Intersections.h`, fetched and read in full at this exact pinned commit
